  m_Text: 'Current Project Meta PoseExamples

    Official Meta pose prefabs wired
    to this project''s UnityXR hand providers.

    Test: Thumbs Up, Thumbs Down,
    Rock, Paper, Scissors, Stop.

    Use overlay: OK requires live hand + shape
    + transform.'
